From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 22:49:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build: lower the PipeWire floor to 1.2.7

Fedora 41 ships PipeWire 1.2.8 and Alpine 3.21 ships 1.2.7, the floor
of Mutter 49. The screen cast code compiles and links against both
when the 1.5.84 and 1.6.0 API stays behind the version checks of
74-fedora43-compat.

Nothing is lost compared with PipeWire 1.4.2.

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
index 6c668d9da..a900eae0e 100644
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -55,7 +55,7 @@ gbm_req = '>= 21.3'
 libdrm_req = '>= 2.4.118'
 
 # screen cast version requirements
-libpipewire_req = '>= 1.4.2'
+libpipewire_req = '>= 1.2.7'
 
 # profiler requirements
 sysprof_req = '>= 3.37.2'
